      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Purpose Title B. 4 Election Commission B. 6 Prime Minister's Department 104,067,500 Amount Purpose Title (RM) Treasury 5,000,000 B. 10 Contribution to Statutory Funds 662,700,000 B. 12 B. 13 Ministry of Foreign Affairs 52,263,000 B. 22 Ministry of Rural and Regional Development 73,949,000 Ministry of Entrepreneurial and B. 26 319,000,000 Co-operative Development B. 28 Ministry of Transport 44,577,000 Ministry of Energy, Water and B. 29 5,615,200 Communications B. 31 Ministry of Tourism 64,559,000 B. 40 Education Service Commission 2,000,000 B. 41 Ministry of Education 1,060,000,000 B. 42 Ministry of Health 836,500,000 B. 43 Ministry of Housing and Local Government 10,000,000 B. 44 Ministry of Culture, Arts and Heritage 110,892,500 B. 45 Ministry of Youth and Sports 9,000,000 B. 46 Ministry of Human Resources 10,000,000 B. 47 Ministry of Information 98,781,800 B. 48 Ministry of Women, Family and 102,497,400 Community Development B. 49 Ministry of Higher Education 250,193,700 B. 62 Ministry of Internal Security 274,315,700 TOTAL 4,127,483,443"
